            "notes": "[Righteous Cleave](item_fa98450c-b553-431d-997a-60fe2b0abb51) is the only good power that cares about weapon hits, so of course we pick it up here.  Just be sure to bank it up and not waste the swing on empty air (I wish they would fix this).\n\n[Lum\u00e9riCo Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) plus [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) is a natural combo.  The constant armor regen means that CH's bonus will always apply, even when you're on low health.\n\nIf you have money, you could consider taking some items that boost your weapon power or lifesteal.",
